SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The aasssseerrtt() macro conforms to ISO/IEC 9899:1999 (“ISO C99”).

     The ssttaattiicc__aasssseerrtt() macro conforms to ISO/IEC 9899:2011 (“ISO C11”).

HHIISSTTOORRYY
